        "review": "This absolutely scratches that “virtual aquarium” itch some of us may get from time to time. \n\nI only have two complaints:\nPressing ESC while in a menu brings up the system menu instead of backing out. As far as I can tell, the only way to back out of a menu is to click the “X” button.\n\nAlso, I feel that challenge rewards could be increased quite a bit. The easy challenges pay less than $100 and the hardest pay around $230. With some fish costing $1000+ (and multiple aquariums to fill) it feels a bit grindy for what is supposed to be a relaxing aquarium game.",
